    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kotogostoi Elija: konamei Elisha boisietab Elija",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kimachei Jehovah komut Elija eng’ kipchurjuriet kwo kipsengwet, koba Elija ak Elisha eng’ Gilgal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Elija Elisha, Asomin ale, tebi eng’ yu; amu kagoyokta Jehovah awa agoi Bet-el. Ak kile Elisha, Ko u ye sobei Jehovah, ak ko u ye sobei sobondang’ung’, ko mametoin. Kochortagei anyun Bet-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimong’ werikab maotik che kimi Bet-el, kobwa ole mi Elisha, ak kolenji inendet, Ingen ile imuti ra Jehovah kiptaiyandeng’ung’ si ma ko kiptaiyandeng’ung’? Ak kile, Ee, angen; osisye okwek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Elija inendet, Elisha, asomin ale tebi eng’ yu; amu kagoyokta Jehovah awa Jeriko. Ak kile, Ko u ye sobei Jehovah, ak ko u ye sobei sobondang’ung’, ko mametoin. Koit anyun Jeriko tuwai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibwa korik ole mi Elisha, werikab maotik che kimi Jeriko, ak kolenji inendet, Ingen ile imuti ra Jehovah kiptaiyandeng’ung’ si ma ko kiptaiyandeng’ung’? Ak kiwol kole, Ee, angen; osisye okwek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Elija inendet, Asomin ale, tebi eng’ yu; amu kagoyokta Jehovah awa Jordan. Ak kile, Ko u ye sobei Jehovah, ak ko u ye sobei sogondang’ung’, ko mametoin. Ak kiba tuwai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba murenik konomu che bo werikab maotik, ak kotononso eng’ ole loo kotokyigei ichek: ak kitononso ichek aeng’u eng’ ye negite Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiireek Elija ngoriennyi ak kotaa, ak kokwere beek, ak kipcheiyo beek, koba komosi ak komosi, ak kilanda tuwai eng’ ole yaamat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingolanda, kolenji Elija Elisha, Som kit ne imache ayaun, kotomo kimuta eng’ ole imi. Ak kile Elisha, Asomin ale, ingotebena kebebertab tamirmirieng’ung’ konyil aeng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Kesom kit ne uui: ago ngigeera ye kimuta awa eng’ ole imi, kobiitu ko u noto eng’ inye; ago ngot ko ma u noto, ko mabiitu noto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kita kobendi, ak kong’alaloti, ogeero, karit ne bo mat, ak mbartanyisiek che bo mat, che kiibesio ichek tuwai; ak kiwa Elija kipsengwet eng’ kipchurjuriet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigeer Elisha, ak kowaach kole, Baba, baba, karisiekab Israel ak bik che lanyei mbartanyisiechato! Ak kimata kogeer inendet kogeny: ak kinam ngoroikyik, ak kogerer kopcheune aeng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinam kogeny ngorietab Elija ne kiibute inendet, ak koweektagei kwo kotonone ngegutab Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinam ngorietab Elija ne kiibute inendet, ak kokwere beek, ak kole, Mi ano Jehovah, Kamuktaindetab Elija? Ak kingo kagokwer beek, kopcheiyo, koba komosi ak komosi: ak kilanda Elisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer werikab maotik che kimi Jeriko ko katokyigei inendet, kole, Tebe tamirmirietab Elija Elisha. Ak kiba kotorokta inendet, ak kong’uruk kot koit ng’ony eng’ tainnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji ichek inendet, Keero, mi koboto otwogiguk bik konomu che kimen; kisomin kele, ingoba kocheng’ kiptaiyandeng’ung’: tamangab ko kagomut inendet tamirmirietab Jehovah kotogosta, ak kokwirji tulonok barak, anan ko atebwosiek. Ak kile, Amat oyokte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingosimji inendet agoi kolilan, komwa kole, Oyokte. Koyokta anyun murenik konom; ak kicheng’at eng’ betusiek somok, ama nyor inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiweek ole mi inendet, ye kita kotebyei eng’ Jeriko; ak kilenji inendet ichek, Kimamwawok alenjok, Amat obe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji bikab nganaset Elisha, Keero, kararan ole mi nganasani, ko u ye keerei kiptaiyandennyu: ago yaachen beek, ama rurtos tuguk eng’ emet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Oibwa sotet ne leel, ak onde orit munyuk. Ak kiipchi inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimanda kwo kondametutab beek, ak kowirji orit munyuk, ak kole, Kamwa Jehovah ko u ni kole, Kaasoob beechu; ma kobiitu meet anan osunatet eng’ oloto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigisoob anyun beechoto agoi ra, ko u ng’olyotab Elisha ne kimwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitogosta eng’ oloto kwo Bet-el: ak ye kita kotogostoi eng’ oret, komong’ werik che mengechen eng’ nganaset, ak kowit inendet, kolenji, Togoste inye kipchurmet, togoste, inye kipchurmet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigusgong’ ak kogeer ichek, ak kochub ichek eng’ kainetab Jehovah. Ak kimong’ kogonik aeng’ che bo tiong’ik che kergei ak keerit eng’ osnet, ak koton artam ak aeng’ eng’ werjoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
